id: condition
name: Condition
kind: signature
side: advantages
tpCost: 14
requirement: Cannot be applied to the ‘Elemental (Fire/Ice/Water/Lightning/Poison)’ Profiles.
requires: !profile:elementalFire, !profile:elementalIce, !profile:elementalWater, !profile:elementalLightning, !profile:elementalPoison
choose: condition
choices: guard-down, drained, shaken, poisoned
summary: Damage applies the chosen Condition; already suffering it, Wound +3(T) instead.
description: >
  This attack is meant to cripple an opponent temporarily.
text: >
  Condition: This attack is meant to cripple an opponent temporarily.
  –TP Cost: 14
  –Requirement: Cannot be applied to the ‘Elemental (Fire/Ice/Water/Lightning/Poison)’ Profiles.
  –Effect: If this Attacking Maneuver deals Damage to an Opponent, apply one of the Combat Conditions below for the duration listed (chosen when gaining this Advantage):

  * Guard Down: Until the start of your next turn.
  * Drained: Until the start of your next turn.
  * Shaken: Until the end of the target’s next turn.
  * Poisoned: Until the end of the target’s next turn.

  If an Opponent is already suffering from your selected Combat Condition, instead increase the Wound Roll for this Attacking Maneuver against them by 3(T).

---

# No script: what this does is read where the Technique is built or the attack is rolled
# (module/technique.mjs, module/signature.mjs). See the plan's feature table.
